    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your home from an army of monsters. Your arsenal includes: a shotgun in your hands, your grandfather's old cannons, and barrels of explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad news \u2013 the monsters are attacking from three sides. Wave after wave, you\u2019ll face more and more of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good news \u2013 your ammo is unlimited, just make sure to reload your shotgun in time. However, you can only buy cannons and explosive barrels between waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be smart \u2013 block paths with your arsenal. Place explosives near the roads and cannons near your home. Eliminate all enemies and save YOUR HOUSE!</p>",
